      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "This matter is taken up through hybrid arr  (virtual/physical mode).\n2. The petitioner, who is in custody in connection with C.T. (Special) Case No.02 of 2019 arising out of Brajarajnagar P.S. Case No.02 of 2019 pending in the court of the learned Additional District Judge -cum- Presiding Officer, Special Court under POCSO Act running for the alleged commission of offence under section 120-B/366-A/370(4)/370- A/344/376(3)/34 of the IPC read with section 6/7, section 9/10 of Prohibition of Child Marriage Act, 2006, section 75/81 of S.J. Act (Care and Protection of Children) Act, 2015 and section 3(1)(w)(i)/3(2)(I) of the S.C./S.T. (PA) Act has filed this application under section 439 of the Cr.P.C. for his release on bail.\n3.",
