      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "Upon hearing the learned counsel for the petitioner and learned counsel for the State and on going through the materials available on record as also the surrounding circumstances; while being not inclined to reconsider the prayer for grant of bail to the Petitioner; this application stands disposed of with the observation that the trial court would do well to take all effective steps as provided in law for conclusion of trial as expeditiously as possible, preferably within a period of four months hence.",
